BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:d-contra-dance-20261127@same-time-next-week
DTSTAMP:20261118T052720Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261127T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261127T230000
SUMMARY:Contra dance · Reality Ministries
LOCATION:Reality Ministries\, 916 Lamond Ave\, Durham\, NC 27701
DESCRIPTION:Live-band contra with a beginner lesson\; no partner or experie
 nce needed and you dance with everyone in the room\, which makes it one of
  the fastest ways to meet people. Same community month to month.\n\nBeginn
 er lesson at 7:30. Nov 27 is the Fourth Friday dance (Big Celtic Fun\, cal
 ler Katie Zanders). Dec 18 is the Triangle Movement Collective Open Contra
 \, with dancing 8–11pm ($10–25).\n\nHow to join: Just show up for the 
 7:30 lesson\; pay at the door\n\nBefore you go: January and February dates
  aren't posted yet. They'll show up here once Triangle Country Dancers pos
 ts them.\n\nhttps://www.tcdancers.org/new-events\n\nListed on Same Time Ne
 xt Week.
URL:https://www.tcdancers.org/new-events
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS="916 Lamond Ave, Durham, NC
  27701";X-APPLE-RADIUS=70;X-TITLE="Reality Ministries":geo:36.002334,-78.9
 08478
END:VEVENT
