DTSTAMP:20261118T052720Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261120T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261120T210000
SUMMARY:Third Friday art walk · Downtown Durham
LOCATION:Durham Arts Council and about 20 downtown galleries and studios\, 
 120 Morris St\, Durham\, NC 27701
DESCRIPTION:Monthly gallery crawl with openings\, receptions and open studi
 os\; the same art crowd turns up each month and receptions are easy places
  to chat.\n\nNov 20 includes the Weird Windows holiday event\; DAC gallery
  openings Dec 18\, Jan 15 & Feb 19 (6-8pm)\n\nHow to join: Just show up\; 
 there's a venue map on the Third Friday website\n\nBefore you go: Individu
 al venue hours vary.\n\nhttps://downtowndurham.com/thirdfriday/\n\nListed 
 on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/thirdfriday/
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS="120 Morris St, Durham, NC 
 27701";X-APPLE-RADIUS=70;X-TITLE="Durham Arts Council and about 20 downtow
 n galleries and studios":geo:35.997239,-78.903792
END:VEVENT
