 'all group\, built to make figure drawing accessible\; beginners and retur
 ning artists welcome.\n\nDoors 6:30\n\nHow to join: Get a $10 ticket via t
 he Draw Y'all Meetup\; bring your own supplies (no messy media)\; 18+\n\nB
 efore you go: Meets the first Monday of the month. Dec 7\, Jan 4 and Feb 1
  aren't posted yet.\n\nhttps://www.meetup.com/drawyall/events/316966625/\n
 \nListed on Same Time Next Week.
