 ely.\n\nHow to join: Register online on the Durham Arts Council's registra
 tion site starting Fri\, Dec 4 at 10am\; no drop-ins\n\nBefore you go: Cla
 y Studio is temporarily in the main DAC building\; classes fill fast.\n\nh
