SUMMARY:cRUNk Run Club · Crank Arm Brewing
LOCATION:Crank Arm Brewing - Durham\, 620 Fernway Ave\, Durham\, NC 27701
DESCRIPTION:Free weekly downtown group run for all paces that ends back at 
 the brewery for social time.\n\n2-\, 3- or 5-mile routes\, then beer/socia
 l at the brewery\n\nHow to join: Just show up\n\nBefore you go: Check the 
 day with the brewery before you go: it's usually listed on Mondays\, but s
 ome listings say Tuesdays.\n\nhttps://www.discoverdurham.com/events/crunk-
 run-club/\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
