UID:d-food-bank-sort-20261111@same-time-next-week
DTSTAMP:20261118T052720Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261111T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261111T113000
SUMMARY:Food Bank sort · Durham branch
LOCATION:Food Bank of Central & Eastern NC - Durham Branch (new facility)\,
  1607 Hamlin Rd\, Building F\, Durham\, NC 27704
DESCRIPTION:Group sort/repack shifts at the Food Bank's new Durham branch\;
  a standing shift puts you alongside the same volunteers.\n\nMorning shift
  shown (9–11:30am). Afternoon shifts run 1–3:30pm Tue–Sat. Closed No
 v 26–27\, Dec 24–25 and Jan 1.\n\nHow to join: Register online\, then 
 book a shift on the Durham branch's volunteer calendar (requests are appro
 ved first)\n\nBefore you go: About 4 miles north of downtown. The old Angi
 er Ave site is closed.\n\nhttps://foodbankcenc.org/durham\n\nListed on Sam
 e Time Next Week.
URL:https://foodbankcenc.org/durham
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS="1607 Hamlin Rd, Building F
 , Durham, NC 27704";X-APPLE-RADIUS=70;X-TITLE="Food Bank of Central & East
 ern NC - Durham Branch (new facility)":geo:36.055247,-78.857999
END:VEVENT
