DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261115T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261115T100000
SUMMARY:Trail run · Bull City Running Co.
LOCATION:A different local trail each week
DESCRIPTION:An all-paces group trail run that explores a new local trail ea
 ch week. A standing weekly run is an easy way to become a familiar face.\n
 \nEvery Sunday at 8am on a different local trail.\n\nHow to join: Find the
  week's trail on Bull City Running's Facebook\, Instagram\, X/Twitter or S
 trava club.\n\nBefore you go: Check Bull City Running's Instagram\, Facebo
 ok or Strava\, or ask in the store\, for each week's trail.\n\nhttps://bul
 lcityrunning.com/events/runclub/\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://bullcityrunning.com/events/runclub/
END:VEVENT
