UID:d-d-and-d-night-20261119@same-time-next-week
DTSTAMP:20261118T052720Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261119T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261119T223000
SUMMARY:D&D Adventurers League · Atomic Empire
LOCATION:Atomic Empire\, 3400 Westgate Dr\, Durham\, NC 27707
DESCRIPTION:Organized-play D&D tables run by a DM. You reserve a seat and p
 lay with whoever else signs up\, so the table is a ready-made social group
 \, and no experience is needed.\n\nBring dice (sold in the store)\, a penc
 il and paper\, and a miniature or marker.\n\nHow to join: Check for open s
 eats on the store's Warhorn page (look for DDEX games)\, then register and
  pay on the Atomic Empire website. A pre-made character sheet is optional.
 \n\nBefore you go: Jan-Feb 2027 dates aren't posted yet. Check whether the
  Nov 26 (Thanksgiving) game runs\; Dec 24 and Dec 31 aren't listed.\n\nhtt
 ps://www.atomicempire.com/Store/Event/313\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week
 .
URL:https://www.atomicempire.com/Store/Event/313
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS="3400 Westgate Dr, Durham, 
 NC 27707";X-APPLE-RADIUS=70;X-TITLE="Atomic Empire":geo:35.966443,-78.9611
 03
END:VEVENT
