SUMMARY:Friday Night Magic · Atomic Empire
LOCATION:Atomic Empire\, 3400 Westgate Dr\, Durham\, NC 27707
DESCRIPTION:A weekly in-store Magic: The Gathering night with several forma
 ts\, including a 'Commander Mixer'. Structured games make it easy to meet 
 other players.\n\nEach night has three formats: Star Trek draft\, Pauper a
 nd a Commander Mixer. The store doesn't list the start time\, so call (919
 ) 490-7900.\n\nHow to join: Register through the store's event listings\, 
 or call the store at (919) 490-7900 to ask the start time and fee.\n\nBefo
 re you go: The start time and entry fee aren't posted. Jan-Feb 2027 dates 
 aren't posted yet.\n\nhttps://www.atomicempire.com/Events\n\nListed on Sam
 e Time Next Week.
