DTSTAMP:20261118T052720Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261116T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261116T193000
SUMMARY:Library Taskmaster (21+) · Durham Main Library
LOCATION:Durham County Library – Main Library (Main Auditorium)\, 300 N R
 oxboro St\, Durham\, NC 27701
DESCRIPTION:An adults-only library take on the comedy show Taskmaster: numb
 ers are drawn to pick contestants for five silly games of wit and creativi
 ty\, and the winners meet in a live final. Because players are drawn at ra
 ndom\, people who've never met end up playing together.\n\nHow to join: Re
 gister on the library's event page\, then arrive early. Seats are first co
 me\, first served.\n\nBefore you go: Ages 21+. Registration is required bu
 t doesn't hold a seat\, so arrive early.\n\nhttps://durhamcountylibrary.li
 bcal.com/event/17285805\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://durhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/17285805
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS="300 N Roxboro St, Durham, 
 NC 27701";X-APPLE-RADIUS=70;X-TITLE="Durham County Library – Main Librar
 y (Main Auditorium)":geo:35.994988,-78.89725
END:VEVENT
