DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261119T183000
SUMMARY:Food distribution · Communities in Partnership
LOCATION:Communities in Partnership\, Durham\, NC (East Durham\; exact addr
 ess given when you sign up)
DESCRIPTION:Help hand out food to neighbors at a community food distributio
 n in East Durham during Hunger & Homelessness Awareness Week.\n\nHow to jo
 in: Sign up for 'Communities in Partnership (East Durham) Food Distributio
 n' on Activate Good's volunteer portal (search for the title). There's als
 o a set-up shift on Wed\, Nov 18\, 10:30am–1:30pm\, and a Spanish-langua
 ge shift at the same time as this one.\n\nBefore you go: Confirm the locat
 ion and check-in details after you sign up.\n\nhttps://volunteer.activateg
 ood.org/\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://volunteer.activategood.org/
END:VEVENT
